.TH FTU-RUST-MIXER 1 "2026-02-22" "ftu-rust-mixer 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ftu-rust-mixer \- Fast Track Ultra mixer for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ftu-rust-mixer
[\fB\-\-card\fR \fIINDEX\fR]
[\fB\-\-load-preset\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-render-mode\fR \fIwgpu|glow\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBftu-rust-mixer\fR is a desktop mixer for the M-Audio Fast Track Ultra on Linux,
using native ALSA control APIs.
.PP
The UI provides routing matrices (analog monitoring and digital routing), a FX section
(including effect program / returns when exposed by the driver), and an "Other controls"
workspace to edit remaining ALSA controls not covered by the matrices.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-card\fR \fIINDEX\fR
ALSA card index to use, for example \fB2\fR for \fBhw:2\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-load-preset\fR \fIFILE\fR
Load a JSON preset file on startup.
.TP
\fB\-\-render-mode\fR \fIwgpu|glow\fR
Select the graphics renderer. Default is \fBwgpu\fR.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show command help.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show program version.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fB~/.ftu-mixer/config.json\fR
User configuration (aliases and hidden channels).
.SH USAGE
.TP
\fBRename channels\fR
Double-click an \fBAIn\fR/\fBDIn\fR/\fBOut\fR label to edit its alias.
.TP
\fBHide/show channels\fR
Right-click an \fBAIn\fR/\fBDIn\fR/\fBOut\fR label to hide or show it. This affects routing matrices only.
.TP
\fBPresets\fR
Presets include all ALSA controls (routing, FX, and other controls).
.SH AUTHOR
Jeremy Ghouali
